# The NSPanelManager commit the tests take the TFT's Nextion project (gui.HMI) and the .proto
# files from. Both belong to NSPanelManager, which builds the TFTs and owns the schema, so the
# firmware repo carries neither. Pinned, so a change upstream cannot break these tests until
# someone bumps this line; bumping it moves the HMI and the schema together.
#
# NSPManager/NSPanelManager devel, "Home Assistant media players and album art for NSPanels
# (#385)". Its HMIs are the same as 38f74e2b, the last before #419, which replaced screensaver2
# with the cover page in both HMIs (NSPManager/NSPanelManager#427). Bump past it once the US HMI
# has screensaver2 back, as the EU one already does.
#
# NSPM_NSPANELMANAGER_REF=<commit or branch> uses another revision for one run (see README.md).
